{
  "id": "QrxFormToQrCode1",
  "name": "Create an art QR code from a form and email it (QRX)",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Art QR code from a form\n\nSomebody describes a picture and gives a link. QRX paints a QR code into that picture, checks that it scans, and the workflow emails the PNG to them.\n\n**Set up**\n1. Install the QRX community node: **Settings → Community nodes → Install → `n8n-nodes-qrx`**.\n2. In **Create QR code**, add a QRX API credential with a key from https://qrx.codes/developers/keys (a free account works).\n3. In **Email the QR code**, connect your Gmail account.\n4. Activate the workflow and open the form's production URL.\n\nCreating a code usually takes under a minute; the QRX node waits for it.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -140
      ],
      "id": "0b3f7a54-5d0e-4f8b-9a7e-2c1d6e4f8a01",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Make an art QR code",
        "formDescription": "Describe a picture and give a link. We'll email you a QR code painted into that picture.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Picture",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "A lighthouse on a cliff at sunset",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Link",
              "placeholder": "https://example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "placeholder": "you@example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "1c2d3e4f-5a6b-4c7d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e01",
      "name": "On form submission",
      "webhookId": "7e0f1a2b-3c4d-4e5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a51"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "code",
        "operation": "create",
        "prompt": "={{ $json.Picture }}",
        "destination": "={{ $json.Link }}",
        "waitForCompletion": true,
        "timeout": 300,
        "simplify": true,
        "options": {
          "downloadImage": true,
          "binaryPropertyName": "data"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-qrx.qrx",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "id": "2d3e4f5a-6b7c-4d8e-9f0a-1b2c3d4e5f02",
      "name": "Create QR code"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('On form submission').item.json.Email }}",
        "subject": "Your QR code is ready",
        "message": "=<p>Here is your QR code. It is attached as a PNG.</p>\n<p><img src=\"{{ $json.imageUrl }}\" alt=\"QR code\" width=\"384\"></p>\n<p>Scans go to {{ $json.destination }} through {{ $json.shortUrl }}.</p>\n<p>View it on QRX: {{ $json.pageUrl }}</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "attachmentsUi": {
            "attachmentsBinary": [
              {
                "property": "data"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "id": "3e4f5a6b-7c8d-4e9f-8a1b-2c3d4e5f6a03",
      "name": "Email the QR code",
      "webhookId": "8f1a2b3c-4d5e-4f6a-9b0c-1d2e3f4a5b62"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "On form submission": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create QR code",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create QR code": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Email the QR code",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {}
}
